{
  "id": "m58l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "Redes y conversiones",
    "en": "Networks and conversions"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Subredes y enteros"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`ip_network('192.168.1.0/24')` representa una subred; `.num_addresses` da cuántas direcciones contiene. Y una IPv4 equivale a un entero de 32 bits: `int(ip_address(...))`."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "import ipaddress",
          "red = ipaddress.ip_network('192.168.1.0/30')",
          "print(red.num_addresses)",
          "print(int(ipaddress.ip_address('0.0.1.0')))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "4",
          "256"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Pensar las IPs como enteros (o bits) ayuda a entender máscaras, rangos y CIDR."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Subnets and integers"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`ip_network('192.168.1.0/24')` represents a subnet; `.num_addresses` gives how many addresses it contains. And an IPv4 equals a 32-bit integer: `int(ip_address(...))`."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "import ipaddress",
          "red = ipaddress.ip_network('192.168.1.0/30')",
          "print(red.num_addresses)",
          "print(int(ipaddress.ip_address('0.0.1.0')))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "4",
          "256"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Thinking of IPs as integers (or bits) helps you understand masks, ranges and CIDR."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m58l2e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `tam_red(cidr)` que devuelva cuántas direcciones tiene la red en notación CIDR (usa num_addresses).",
        "en": "Define `tam_red(cidr)` returning how many addresses the CIDR network has (use num_addresses)."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def tam_red(cidr):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def tam_red(cidr):",
        "    return ipaddress.ip_network(cidr).num_addresses"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "ipaddress.ip_network(cidr).num_addresses."
        ],
        "en": [
          "ipaddress.ip_network(cidr).num_addresses."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "tam_red",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "192.168.1.0/30"
              ],
              "expected": 4
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "10.0.0.0/24"
              ],
              "expected": 256
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m58l2e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `ip_a_entero(ip)` que convierta una IPv4 (texto) en su número entero de 32 bits.",
        "en": "Define `ip_a_entero(ip)` converting an IPv4 (text) into its 32-bit integer."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def ip_a_entero(ip):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def ip_a_entero(ip):",
        "    return int(ipaddress.ip_address(ip))"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "int(ipaddress.ip_address(ip))."
        ],
        "en": [
          "int(ipaddress.ip_address(ip))."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "ip_a_entero",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "0.0.0.1"
              ],
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "0.0.1.0"
              ],
              "expected": 256
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "255.255.255.255"
              ],
              "expected": 4294967295
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}